definitions:
  orphanTokens: "declared in CSS, referenced nowhere (components or CSS) — dead, or a consumer-facing API token"
  undefinedRefsFromComponents: a component uses var(--x) that is neither a compiled CSS token nor a component-local var — likely a typo or stale build (actionable)
  componentLocalVars: "a var a component both uses and declares itself (e.g. --gv-icon-fill-display) — a component-local API custom property, not a design token (informational)"
  undefinedRefsInCss: the CSS references var(--x) it never declares
  jsonCssDrift: "a DTCG source token whose expected CSS var is absent from the compiled CSS — stale build-tokens, or a naming-transform mismatch (heuristic)"
